Ten stars in a row: a loop that prints one star per pass
Watch the GIF speed up after the first couple of iterations

++++++++++                10 passes in cell 0
[
  >[-]                    reset cell 1
  ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++  42: the star character
  .                       print it
  <-                      back to the counter and one pass less
]
